<title>JAPAN: Torishima Pump -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Torishima Pump -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.44		vs	   12.71</p>
<p> Operating	  439    million    vs	  667    million</p>
<p> Current	    501    million    vs	  516    million</p>
<p> Net		  287    million    vs	  285    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.69 yen	  vs	    9.61 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Torishima Pump Mfg Co Ltd specialises in pumps especially large, high-tech pumps.</p>
</text>
